  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am a part of the PvP/Game community, and a much needed feature is for us the disable nametags in our worlds. I currently create PvP/Game worlds, and we ask our members to turn off nametags for the sake of stealth and fairness. Nametags make it so people can see you anywhere which ruins the game. sadly even after asking people to turn off nametags, there is dishonest people who keep them on. Those people get an advantage as a result and we have no way to track if someone has nametags enabled or not so this makes preventing cheating impossible.\nI notice you guys have been adding in a lot of requested features lately so I am hoping you will do this for to PvP/Game community",
